Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dermatology and skin clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has kind reviews, but patients can't book a skin check online, and the conditions you treat don't have their own pages for people searching a symptom.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: skin check booking, separate medical and cosmetic paths, condition pages written as general information, a cosmetic menu with fee ranges and a consent and photo policy page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain your clinic owns and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. You approve every page, and nothing promises a result. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
